{"unit_id":"hunan36__dsh-lock-run#card-zh","repo":"hunan36/dsh-lock-run","commit":"6737213ff7973cf161c00a0761128fe472040d76","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lock-run 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的锁屏防休眠插件。它在通用设置中加入运行方式选择，并由后台服务检查 Agent 会话和后台任务是否仍在运行。任务活跃时，插件按所选模式启动系统电源保持助手；支持关闭、允许熄屏但阻止系统休眠、同时保持屏幕点亮，以及无论任务状态始终保持唤醒。任务结束后会等待宽限时间再释放保持状态，适合需要锁屏后继续执行 DSH 工作的用户。可在设置或补丁配置中调整模式、轮询间隔和宽限时间；需要系统提供对应的 caffeinate、systemd-inhibit 或 PowerShell 能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:28-42","src/service.ts:97-131","src/power.ts:27-46"]}
{"unit_id":"hunan36__dsh-lock-run#card-en","repo":"hunan36/dsh-lock-run","commit":"6737213ff7973cf161c00a0761128fe472040d76","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lock-run keeps the DSH web host awake while agents or background jobs run. A settings selector offers four modes, from off to always awake. The service checks activity, starts a platform power helper during work, and releases it after a grace period. It supports macOS, Linux, and Windows.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:28-42","src/service.ts:97-131","src/power.ts:27-46"]}
